{"sourceUrl":"https://energy.cug.edu.cn/info/1014/3919.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:20.729997+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://energy.cug.edu.cn/info/1014/3919.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><strong><span>新能源学院</span></strong><strong><span>2025</span></strong><strong><span>年第</span></strong><strong><span>十一</span></strong><strong><span>届研招校园开放日活动方案</span></strong></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>中国地质大学</span><span>(武汉)新能源学院面向国家对新型能源体系建设的重大战略需求和新能源领域复合型科技人才培养需求</span></span><span><span>，以新能源领域的</span><span>“基础研究、应用研究、产业化研究”科技创新为牵引，以“本、硕、博”跨学科国际化人才培养为纽带，创新管理体制与运行机制，与国内外优势科研单位和领军企业联合共建新能源领域多元化合作平台，探索人才链、创新链、学科链、产业链“四链融合”的高校新能源工科建设新模式，目标是成为相关领域国际交流合作的重要枢纽和创新成果产业化推广应用的重要引擎。</span></span><span>现将</span><span>新能源学院</span><span>2025</span><span>年第</span><span>十一</span><span>届</span><span>研招</span><span>校园开放日活动方案</span><span>通知</span><span>如下</span><span>：</span></p><p><strong><span>一</span></strong><strong><span>、申请</span></strong><strong><span>对象及条件</span></strong></p><p><span>申请人</span><span>为拟攻读新能源学院硕士研究生的</span><span>校内外</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>届优秀本科毕业生</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>二、</span><strong><span>时间</span></strong><strong><span>及工作</span></strong><strong><span>安排</span></strong></p><p><span>1．学生报名：</span><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span><span>—</span></span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>20</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><span>，报名学生通过</span><span>学</span><span>校</span><span>“</span><a href=\"http://epo.cug.edu.cn/Open/ZsTkssXly/Signin.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>研招校园开放日报名系统</span></a><span>”</span><span>填报申请</span><span><span>（</span><span>“</span></span><span>申请院系</span><span>”</span><span>信息未填视为报名不成功</span><span>）。报名学生请于</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span><span>日前将以下材料合并成一个</span><span>pdf文档）扫描件打包发送邮件，打包文件名为“姓名-本科学校名称-申请专业名称”，申请材料提交邮箱</span></span><span>：</span><strong><span>xnyb@cug.edu.cn</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>①中国地质大学（武汉）2025年研招校园开放日活动申请表（报名系统导出后A4纸正反双面打印）1份；</span></p><p><span>②本人身份证和学生证原件扫描件（</span><span>PDF版</span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>③本科阶段成绩单和专业排名信息（复印件须加盖教务处或院系公章）；</span></p><p><span>④国家大学英语四、六级考试成绩单（或</span><span>其它</span><span>英语等级证明等）；</span></p><p><span>⑤</span><span>其它</span><span>证明材料（如已发表的论文、各类获奖证书、专家推荐信等）</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.</span> <span>校园开放日活动时间为</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>2</span><span>日。</span><span><span>招生单位审核学生提交的材料后，将于</span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日</span><span>前邮件通知符合条件的学生参加活动。</span></p><p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>具体</span></strong><strong><span>活动</span></strong><strong><span>日程</span></strong></p><p><span>采用线上线下相结合的方式。外地学生采用线上形式，本地学生采用线下形式。</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span> 日期</span></p></td><td><p><span>时间</span></p></td><td><p><span> 地点</span></p></td><td><p><span>活动内容</span></p></td><td><p><span>备注</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>7月2日</span></p><p><br/></p></td><td><p><span>9：30-10：00</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>新能源学院报告厅（未来城校区崇宇楼一楼）</span></p></td><td><p><span>学生签到</span></p></td><td><p><span>线下学生</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span>10：00</span><span>-1</span><span>2：0</span><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span>招生政策及学科特色宣讲</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span>线下、线上学生</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>交流互动</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>参观</span></span><span><span>窗体顶端</span></span></p><p><span>参观</span><span>深层地热富集机理与高效开发全国重点实验室</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><br/>注：具体活动以现场安排为准，请关注相关通知。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、其他事项</span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span> <span>我院为营员提供开放日期间在校餐食补贴。</span></p><p><span>2. 开放日期间学生安全由本人负责，我院将为外校营员购买意外险。</span></p><p><span>3. 本次活动仅开展招生宣传，</span><span>参加研招校园开放日活动的学生必须遵守中国地质大学（武汉）相关规定，按照统一安排参加各项活动。</span></p><p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>、联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span>学院</span><span><span>网址：</span><span>https://energy.cug.edu.cn/</span></span></p><p><span>通讯地址：</span><span><span>湖北省武汉市东湖高新区锦程街</span>68<span>号中国地质大学</span><span>(</span><span>武汉</span><span>)</span></span><span>新能源</span><span><span>学院</span></span></p><p><span>邮政编码：</span><span>430078</span></p><p><span>联系人：</span><span>刘老师</span></p><p><span>电话：</span><span> 027-6</span><span><span>5278727</span></span></p><p><span> Email: </span><span><span>xnyb@cug.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>中国地质大学（武汉）</span><span>新能源学院</span></p><p><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"d48cc10329d00890eee95bc587ba0c54ba94f82432d98bd60b7597fe853f30e8","textLength":1154,"sourceSha256":"27c4aecf7e48b0006f1bee4c9223f98bec1c240b8eae7447324f949832d6864a","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-34fd807a7135de2c6926","title":"2025年中国地质大学（武汉）新能源学院第十一届研招校园开放日活动方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:20.729997+00:00"}
